        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Treaty of Bastia\n- People: Lord William Bentinck\n- Organizations: British forces in Italy\n- Topics: Corsican nationalists, Napoleonic Wars\n\nFacts:\n- The Treaty of Bastia was an agreement signed in 1814 near the end of the Napoleonic Wars.\n- The Treaty of Bastia was signed between Corsican nationalists and Lord William Bentinck.\n- Lord William Bentinck was the commander of British forces in Italy at the time of the Treaty of Bastia.\n- Lord William Henry Cavendish-Bentinck was born on 14 September 1774 and died on 17 June 1839.\n- Lord William Henry Cavendish-Bentinck was known as Lord William Bentinck.\n- Lord William Bentinck was a British soldier and statesman.",
